flickos-software (1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Community apps (design phase 2): apps from FlickOS's community
    repository show as the source FlickOS Community, with a note that
    FlickOS builds them from the developer's source and reviews them;
    FlickOS's own apps with metainfo show as FlickOS. Both install
    through PackageKit.
  * The front page's shelves come from featured.json: Made for FlickOS,
    then Apps to start with. The package's copy until the list from the
    store's Worker is fetched (at most once a day, nothing sent about
    the user); list --shelves prints them.
  * The index is built again after the upgrade (its format changed).

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 11:13:22 +0800

